        "content": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"zh-CN\">\n<head>\n<meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n<meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\n<title>4.A Horrible Earthquake 可怕的地震</title>\n<script>\nwindow.MathJax = {\n  tex: {\n    inlineMath: [['$', '$']],\n    displayMath: [['$$', '$$']]\n  }\n};\n</script>\n<script src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/mathjax@3/es5/tex-mml-chtml.js\" async></script>\n<style>\n  html, body {\n    margin: 0;\n    padding: 0;\n  }\n  body {\n    background: #17b3a3;\n    font-family: \"Kaiti SC\", \"KaiTi\", \"STKaiti\", serif;\n  }\n  .page {\n    position: relative;\n    width: 540px;\n    min-height: 720px;\n    margin: 0 auto;\n    background-color: #fdfdf7;\n    background-image:\n      linear-gradient(to right, rgba(150,190,180,0.30) 1px, transparent 1px),\n      linear-gradient(to bottom, rgba(150,190,180,0.30) 1px, transparent 1px);\n    background-size: 18px 18px;\n    box-sizing: border-box;\n    padding: 60px 55px 30px 75px;\n  }\n  /* left teal binding strip */\n  .page::before {\n    content: \"\";\n    position: absolute;\n    top: 0;\n    left: 0;\n    width: 46px;\n    height: 100%;\n    background: #17b3a3;\n  }\n  .page::after {\n    content: \"\";\n    position: absolute;\n    top: 0;\n    left: 60px;\n    width: 1px;\n    height: 100%;\n    background: rgba(200,120,120,0.35);\n  }\n  h1.title-bar {\n    position: relative;\n    z-index: 2;\n    margin: 20px 0 0 0;\n    background: #a34445;\n    color: #ffffff;\n    font-family: \"Arial Rounded MT Bold\", \"Trebuchet MS\", Arial, sans-serif;\n    font-size: 21px;\n    font-weight: bold;\n    text-align: center;\n    padding: 12px 0;\n    letter-spacing: 0.5px;\n  }\n  h2.subtitle {\n    position: relative;\n    z-index: 2;\n    margin: 22px 0 30px 0;\n    text-align: center;\n    color: #1f9c4d;\n    font-size: 20px;\n    font-weight: bold;\n    letter-spacing: 2px;\n  }\n  .body-text {\n    position: relative;\n    z-index: 2;\n    color: #2f5fbf;\n    font-size: 14.5px;\n    line-height: 30px;\n    text-align: justify;\n    letter-spacing: 0.5px;\n  }\n  .body-text p {\n    margin: 0;\n    text-indent: 2em;\n  }\n  .u {\n    text-decoration: underline;\n    text-decoration-color: #2f5fbf;\n  }\n  .footer {\n    position: relative;\n    z-index: 2;\n    text-align: center;\n    margin-top: 70px;\n    color: #333333;\n    font-size: 17px;\n    font-family: \"Trebuchet MS\", Arial, sans-serif;\n    letter-spacing: 1px;\n  }\n</style>\n</head>\n<body>\n<div class=\"page\">\n\n  <h1 class=\"title-bar\">4.A Horrible Earthquake</h1>\n\n  <h2 class=\"subtitle\">可怕的地震</h2>\n\n  <div class=\"body-text\">\n    <p>地震前，<span class=\"u\">水井和运河</span>里的<span class=\"u\">泉</span>水都涨涌起来。但是却没人<span class=\"u\">判断</span>出地震即将来临。震那间，一切都在摇晃，<span class=\"u\">似乎</span>整个世界都要<span class=\"u\">结束</span>。<span class=\"u\">数以百万的</span>砖房和许多水坝遭到<span class=\"u\">破坏</span>；铁路<span class=\"u\">轨</span><span class=\"u\">道</span>都变成无用的铁条；<span class=\"u\">煤矿</span>常道纷纷<span class=\"u\">爆裂</span>，发出有<span class=\"u\">臭味的蒸</span><span class=\"u\">气</span>；到处都有<span class=\"u\">骑车的人</span>被巨大的<span class=\"u\">裂缝陷住</span>。</p>\n    <p>第二天，所有报纸都纷纷从<span class=\"u\">大字标题</span>或主要<span class=\"u\">标题</span>报道了这一<span class=\"u\">事件</span>。<span class=\"u\">记者</span>们描述了<span class=\"u\">灾难</span>的<span class=\"u\">大概情况</span>，全<span class=\"u\">国</span>都被地震的<span class=\"u\">破坏</span>和灾民们<span class=\"u\">极度的苦难</span>所震撼。当人们读到<span class=\"u\">幸存者</span>以\"<span class=\"u\">恭喜啊</span>，你还活着。\"来互相祝贺时，都被感动了。人们不仅<span class=\"u\">衷心地表达</span>了他们的同情，而且还<span class=\"u\">立刻</span>组织起来帮助灾民。伤员被救助了，死者被<span class=\"u\">埋葬</span>了，吓坏的幸存者被从<span class=\"u\">废墟</span>中<span class=\"u\">挖出来</span>了，栖身处、净水和<span class=\"u\">电力</span>也很快得到提供。多亏了人们的帮助，灾区的损失被减到了最小。</p>\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"footer\">· 8/44·</div>\n\n</div>\n</body>\n</html>"
